(d) Do not impose a fee for the copy, download, license, or access, or make
    receipt of the Covered Software conditional on a purchase.

4. Restrictions

Except with separate written permission from the relevant copyright holders,
you may not:

(a) Sell, rent, commercially sublicense, or otherwise charge for the Covered
    Software, whether original or modified, in source or compiled form.

(b) Offer paid access to the Covered Software through a hosted service,
    subscription, or other paid application service.

(c) Bundle the Covered Software into a paid software product or distribute
    it as a paid white-label or rebranded application.

(d) Use the Covered Software for purposes outside Section 2, except for
