The internal business use permitted by Section 2(c) is not prohibited
merely because the organization operates commercially. Internal use does
not include offering the Covered Software to external customers as part
of the organization's product or service.

These restrictions apply to the Covered Software and modifications to it.
They do not change the separate licenses of third-party dependencies.

